:cantDeficiencyBasicSSP :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en .

:otherCantDeficiencyBasicSSP :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en .

:conditionalRegenerativeBrake :dependencyNote "When `not electrified` is chosen in parameter 1.1.1.2.2.1.1, then this parameter is not applicable. "@en .

:contactLineSystemType :dependencyNote "If this parameter is repeated, parameters 1.1.1.2.2.1.2, and 1.1.1.2.2.2 shall be created also for the corresponding type. These two parameters are to be considered children of the current. "@en .

:conditionsAppliedRegenerativeBraking :dependencyNote "When `not electrified` is chosen in parameter 1.1.1.2.2.1.1, then this parameter is not applicable. Mandatory when parameter 1.1.1.2.2.4 announces Conditions."@en .

:conditionsSwitchClassBSystems :dependencyNote "Applicable when at least two different class of protection systems exist."@en .

:switchProtectControlWarning :dependencyNote "Applicable when at least two different protection, control and warning systems exist."@en .

:conditionsUseReflectivePlates :dependencyNote "A value is mandatory if the value of parameter \"Permit of use of reflective plates\" is boolean \"Yes\""@en .

:contactStripMaterial :dependencyNote "Mandatory only if “Overhead contact line (OCL)” is selected in 1.1.1.2.2.1.1, otherwise the parameter is not applicable."@en;
