:dataRadioCompatible :dependencyNote "GSM-R and ETCS L2 must be installed for this parameter to be applicable."@en;
  :eratvIndex "4.13.2.8" .

:eddyCurrentBrakingConditionsDocument :dependencyNote "Mandatory value to be provided when 1.1.1.1.6.2/Use of eddy current brakes is  allowed under conditions  or  allowed under conditions only for emergency brake"@en .

:energySupplySystem :dependencyNote "When `not electrified` is chosen in parameter 1.1.1.2.2.1.1, then this parameter is not applicable."@en;
  :eratvIndex "4.10.1" .

:errorCorrectionsOnboard :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en .

:etcsDegradedSituation :dependencyNote "Mandatory when ETCS is present. "@en .

:etcsInfill :dependencyNote "Mandatory in case of ETCS level 1 and infill device(s) are installed. Otherwise it is not applicable."@en;
  :eratvIndex "4.13.1.3" .

:etcsMVersion :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en .

:etcsSystemCompatibility :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en;
  :eratvIndex "4.13.1.8" .

:etcsTransmittedTrackConditions :dependencyNote "Mandatory when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1) and value of 1.1.1.3.2.12 is True."@en .

:gsmRActiveMobiles :dependencyNote "GSM-R and ETCS level 2 must be installed for this parameter to be applicable."@en .

:etcsNationalPacket44Function :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en .

:etcsRestrictionsConditionsDoc :dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en .

:tdsFrenchTrainDetectionSystemLimitation :dependencyNote "Only applicable on running tracks in France"@en .

:maximumInterferenceCurrent :dependencyNote "Evaluation parameters must be added if preferred bands are not used."@en .

:minVehicleImpedance :dependencyNote "Mandatory only for track circuits";
