:tdsMaximumMagneticField :dependencyNote "Mandatory for train detection systems based on axle counters"@en .

:gsmRAdditionalInfo :dependencyNote "GSM-R must be installed for this parameter to be applicable"@en .

:gprsForETCS :dependencyNote "GSM-R and ETCS L2 must be installed for this parameter to be applicable."@en .

:gsmROptionalFunctions :dependencyNote "GSM-R (parameter 1.1.1.3.3.1) must be installed for this parameter to be applicable"@en .

:gsmRVersion :dependencyNote "GSM-R must be installed for this parameter to be applicable and a value to be provided. If this property is not used, all GSM-R related properties should not be used either."@en;
